      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.11,
      "end_seconds": 151.22,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. My husband and I live above the shop"
