      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.3,
      "end_seconds": 255.68,
      "duration_seconds": 22.38,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for cough and weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.25,
      "end_seconds": 259.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
